{"4586510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Psyai", "steam_appid": 4586510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Foreordination</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  You are <strong>Leonard</strong>, an AI diagnostician in <strong>Neo Lux</strong> — a district where signal jammers are common</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  courtesy and everyone's hiding something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A man kicks in your door. Burns a photograph. Says one word: <strong>Athanatos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Then your access card goes missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <i>Find out where it went.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <i>Psyai</i> is a point-and-click adventure inspired by <i>Policenauts</i> and <i>Snatcher</i>. Classic verb menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   AI diagnostics. CRT pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point-and-click investigation</strong> — LOOK, INTERACT, TALK, USE. Every object tells you something.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Diagnostics</strong> — Run a full patient session. Three layers deep: Surface, Subconscious, Core. Pick what  your report says.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office, street, food court, alley, subway — <strong>five rooms across Neo Lux</strong>, about</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>30-60 minutes</strong>. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Foreordination</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  You are <strong>Leonard</strong>, an AI diagnostician in <strong>Neo Lux</strong> — a district where signal jammers are common</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  courtesy and everyone's hiding something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A man kicks in